  "changes": [
    "Fixed controlled subtype entry counter additions use existing providers and full actual/projected replacement characteristics; simultaneous entering providers supply no replacement.",
    "Graveyard-origin entry counter metadata applies to actual graveyard casts through any valid permission, preserving ordinary cost, timing and countered destinations.",
    "Immutable mixed pre-entry counter payloads are shared by returns and frozen-target-controller searches, using the existing owned entry and counter replacement transactions.",
    "A distinct post-entry return operation collects exact successful results through choices/failures, freezes entry observers, then stages one subsequent counter-placement batch. Projected outcomes use the same completed entry world.",
    "Controlled-creature counter events qualify current recipient controller/creature characteristics independently of placer and counter kind. Conditional named-mode and OncePerTurn trigger wrappers compose.",
    "Source-independent first-event qualification reuses existing exact object/player placement history; complete positive mixed batches record history before dispatch. The queued packet retains its event qualification and exact recipient, so subsequent response counters cannot disable it or recursively create another first-event trigger."
  ],
  "focused_outcomes": [
    "fixed_subtype_entry_bonus_is_one_per_provider_not_existing_dragons",
    "simultaneous_provider_absence_and_prior_presence_match_projection",
    "subtype_choice_and_counter_replacements_are_precommit_in_both_worlds",
    "graveyard_origin_counters_require_an_actual_cast_and_keep_normal_costs",
    "another_graveyard_permission_still_uses_graveyard_origin_and_countered_spell_can_retry",
    "mixed_return_counters_are_visible_to_entry_observers_and_keyword_rules",
    "counters_after_returns_do_not_retroactively_enable_entry_observers",
    "post_return_batch_tracks_successes_through_entry_choices_and_failed_aura_return",
    "post_return_replacement_results_match_projection_without_parent_mutation",
    "searched_land_enters_tapped_with_stun_even_if_target_survives",
    "illegal_destroy_target_causes_no_search_and_zero_selection_still_shuffles",
    "mode_gated_own_creature_counter_observer_ignores_placer_and_triggers_once",
    "first_mixed_counter_event_is_deduplicated_and_frozen_before_response",
    "first_history_precedes_observer_arrival_and_survives_copy_control_and_turn_boundaries",
    "self_and_entry_counters_are_first_events_and_prohibited_placements_do_not_consume_first",
    "private_search_counter_payload_is_owned_across_raw_index_restore_and_parent_disposal",
    "mixed_entry_counters_use_replacements_and_prohibitions_without_canceling_return",
    "stale_return_target_never_receives_post_entry_counters_on_its_later_incarnation",
    "post_entry_counter_completion_is_owned_while_return_choices_suspend"
  ],
